<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/30/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Patents Board established under Part II is dissolved."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/30/eng@> .
