<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/30/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who, immediately before the appointed date, was appointed as an Examiner by the dissolved Board shall continue in that office and be deemed for the purposes of this Act to have been appointed under section 9A. Amendment of section 8"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/30/eng@> .
